 Please note that I'm not questioning the quality of nethack.  What I am 
 questioning is the assumption that it is perfect, or even decent in terms 
 of game balance.  I think the major problem with nethack is that it is 
 maintained my a bunch of nethack.gods who know all the tricks and therefor
 think its easy.  It ain't.  Its impossible without hints from this group,
 lots of source code delving or years of time playing.  I suspect that most
 of the people who stick with it 'cheat', because thats the only way to get
 anywhere unless you know the 100 or so little tricks.  (Like throwing gems
 at unicorns.  Maybe there is some mythology there, but it sure isn't 
 intuitive to me.)


